    "detailed_description": "<h1>Current Main Walkthrough</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/9ffb477fe262f3b45bc29b6c4ceca5ae.avif?t=1746035717\" data-has-big width=800 height=406 /></span><br>You can also play Jiya Special after the main walkthrough~</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm delighted to have you play my game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/c612157479dd9f750f4a731036492108.poster.avif?t=1746035717\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/c612157479dd9f750f4a731036492108.webm?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/c612157479dd9f750f4a731036492108.mp4?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/8a456a075e5821e0a89d8a1665bb1cf9.poster.avif?t=1746035717\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/8a456a075e5821e0a89d8a1665bb1cf9.webm?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/8a456a075e5821e0a89d8a1665bb1cf9.mp4?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/40363dfb4bd9ae5accd1bf567293b7e5.poster.avif?t=1746035717\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/40363dfb4bd9ae5accd1bf567293b7e5.webm?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/40363dfb4bd9ae5accd1bf567293b7e5.mp4?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What we have in-game so far</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game type: Adult Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations: 60+ animations with sexual sound effects featuring a lot of girls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background Music: Lighthearted music sets the tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Branches: Two main branches alter the story plots with completely different animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Season: This is Season 0 (the pilot season) of City Lights Love Bites!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Progress: 75% completed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purpose of  the pilot season: You will see a lot of sex scenes, yes, and all girls want MC, yes. All motivations will be explained by the end of the pilot season, offering a deeper understanding of the story's direction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/17e0e7c90b26f43b6f872a8f16b3d7ae.poster.avif?t=1746035717\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/17e0e7c90b26f43b6f872a8f16b3d7ae.webm?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011560/extras/17e0e7c90b26f43b6f872a8f16b3d7ae.mp4?t=1746035717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What I will do for this game down the road</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Seasons:</strong> I plan to create a visual novel sandbox for future games, referring to Chapter 11 in the pilot season. In the future, I\u2019d also love to try Unreal Engine 5! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My <strong>update schedule</strong> is usually every 4 weeks. Going to end this season by developing 30 tasks in the final chapter(11) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Special Contents featuring the most popular characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now I'm using two 4090 graphics card to do the work. Dumping my 2060!</p></li></ul>",
